{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TWhBE8zoMzB6E8t72RNkri","type":"tool_result","content":"10:# accessors for it, so the run-status contract — every run (ralph or harden)\n279:# for ralph; provider/model/effort/lenses/rounds for harden). Blank values are\n386:# round (harden round / ralph iteration) and worker/lens summary, preserving the\n774:# the type's stop|steer dot-file basename (`<base>/.harden-stop`, …). Centralises\n775:# the harden/converge pattern of \"look up the signal file, prepend the path\" so\n925:# The hub's New-run flow picks a loop type (ralph|harden), gathers config, and\n932:# harden takes target, rounds, lenses, provider, model, effort.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01ED8HbuxfqtYZgMa4GKptqQ","session_id":"39778425-941f-49ab-8330-34f036939f47","uuid":"0f589b3d-79f9-43dd-9e64-05135b9bff68","timestamp":"2026-05-27T07:51:14.778Z","subagent_type":"Explore","task_description":"Walk almanac codebase for friction"}
